{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aTiny Dino\u300b is an idle nurturing game located at the bottom of your screen, accompanying you while you work or study. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > They will spit out gems to earn you profits, and you can also plant trees or build structures to let them live freely, growing alongside you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Different Types of Dinos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grass, Fire, Water attributes, and more\u2014dinos of different attributes come in unique colors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build your vibrant dino legion! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678750/extras/c9a3f58f2e2979c21a5fc49a1c7db659.poster.avif?t=1749307708\" width=800 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678750/extras/c9a3f58f2e2979c21a5fc49a1c7db659.webm?t=1749307708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678750/extras/c9a3f58f2e2979c21a5fc49a1c7db659.mp4?t=1749307708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle Other Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your dinos will automatically fight opponents based on your team setup! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise the Strongest Dino Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each dino has its own strengths\u2014assemble the ultimate team! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interact with Your Dinos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can pick them up anytime, feed them, or pet them\u2014they\u2019ll chase after food! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nurture New Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Try to raise the most unique dinos! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Dino Homeland</strong></h2><p cl